 * - SYNC: Push data in chunks to a GitHub repo (backup/chunk-{N}.json)
 * - PULL: Fetch chunks from GitHub repo and restore to DB
 * - AUTO-SYNC: Incremental push (only new records) after DB writes
 * - AUTO-RESTORE: Detect reset (0% completeness) → pause sync → pull from GitHub
